{"meta":{"ui":"dashboard","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show me how the product did this month as an inline dashboard with a toggle between 7, 30 and 90 days that changes every number. Four stat tiles with their change, each period: 7 days: revenue $18.4k (+4.1%), sign-ups 312 (+6.0%), churn 2.9% (-0.2%), active users 13,870 (+1.4%); 30 days: $78.9k (+8.5%), 1,340 (+11.2%), 3.1% (+0.4%), 14,260 (+6.3%); 90 days: $221k (+15.3%), 3,905 (+9.8%), 3.4% (-0.6%), 14,260 (+12.1%). A line chart of revenue over the period, and a bar chart of sign-ups by channel (Organic, Paid, Referral, Social, Email) that adds up to the sign-ups: 7 days 128, 84, 52, 31, 17; 30 days 540, 372, 218, 134, 76; 90 days 1,580, 1,010, 640, 420, 255. Under them a table of the top five plans I can sort by any column, starting with revenue, highest first: Pro 1,340 subs, $38,900, churn 2.1%; Team 412, $24,700, 1.4%; Starter 2,980, $8,900, 5.2%; Business 96, $4,800, 0.9%; Student 640, $1,600, 6.8%.","text":"ChatCard \"Product performance\" \"Key metrics for the selected period\" icon:\"insights\" status:\"Live\" tone:accent w:390\n  state range=\"30 days\"\n  state sort=\"revenue\"\n  state desc=true\n  Segments =range options:[\"7 days\",\"30 days\",\"90 days\"]\n  Grid cols:2 gap:10\n    StatTile \"Revenue\" \"vs previous period\" value:=range==\"7 days\"?\"$18.4k\":range==\"30 days\"?\"$78.9k\":\"$221k\" delta:=range==\"7 days\"?\"+4.1%\":range==\"30 days\"?\"+8.5%\":\"+15.3%\" icon:\"payments\"\n    StatTile \"Sign-ups\" \"new accounts\" value:=range==\"7 days\"?\"312\":range==\"30 days\"?\"1,340\":\"3,905\" delta:=range==\"7 days\"?\"+6.0%\":range==\"30 days\"?\"+11.2%\":\"+9.8%\" icon:\"person_add\"\n    StatTile \"Churn\" \"lost customers\" value:=range==\"7 days\"?\"2.9%\":range==\"30 days\"?\"3.1%\":\"3.4%\" delta:=range==\"7 days\"?\"-0.2%\":range==\"30 days\"?\"+0.4%\":\"-0.6%\" invert:true icon:\"trending_down\"\n    StatTile